her value often correlates with rich biodiversity.So this might be correct, but I'm not sure if it's directly stated.\n\nB) Special ecosystem coastal wetland plays an irreplaceable role in global ecological balance.\n- The context doesn't talk about global ecological balance, just that their value is high compared to other areas.So this might not be correct.\n\nC) Coastal wetlands have high biological productivity and important coastal protection functions.Option B is not mentioned at all, so it's the correct understanding.</think>.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
