alogue.\n   - **Option B** is incorrect because Xiao Ma's words are consistent throughout the dialogue.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nThe correct answer is **B) Xiao Ma's words are inconsistent** because her statements are consistent in expressing her opinion about the film.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
