evelop productivity, you need to reform production relations.\n3. Reforming production relations requires a firm consciousness of taking the road of reform.\n4. Therefore, to strengthen material civilization, you must have that firm consciousness. This directly supports option A.\n5. Option B involves people\'s beliefs, which aren\'t addressed in the context, so it\'s not a direct deduction.\n6. Options C and D are not supported by the context. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 79%|#######9  | 476/600 [10:49<00:20,  6.05it/s]
