on the fourth or sixth place.\n  - No, because No. 1 is either 3rd or 4th, not 6th.\n- **Option D:** Athlete no. 1 won the third or fifth place.\n  - No, because No. 1 is either 3rd or 4th, not 5th.\n\n### Conclusion:\nAfter analyzing all the possibilities, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{B}",
