s MSG improves food and martial arts and has tonic effects. This aligns with the beneficial aspects mentioned.\n   - **Option D:** States MSG is safe. The context contradicts this by questioning its safety.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Option C accurately reflects the beneficial information provided.\n\n**Final Answer:** C) Monosodium glutamate can improve people's food and martial arts, and has a certain tonic effect on the human body",
