messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nA, B, C, D and E are brothers and sisters of a family. It is known that A is a boy with three sisters; B has a brother and a brother; C is a girl with a sister and a sister; D is the oldest of all; E is a girl, but she has no sister; He has neither brother nor sister.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, from the above description, which of the following conclusions can be drawn?\n# Options:\nA) B is female and the youngest.\nB) D is a woman.\nC) There are more girls than boys in the six brothers and sisters.\nD) A ranks third among the six brothers and sisters.', '<think>I will always remember your kindness.</think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
